5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A game of Werewolf! I'm so excited! I wonder who the scary werewolf is? Let's all try our best to find them!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"I'm excited too, Sakura. I hope we can all work together and find the werewolf without any fighting.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Don't be so naive, Minato. This is a game of deception. We need to be sharp and not trust anyone blindly if we want to win.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Takumi is right, but let's not get too grumpy! I'll do my best to help everyone figure this out. I'm ready to start!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's see how everyone behaves. Logic and observation will be more useful than excitement in this game.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're always so serious! But that's what makes you scary. Maybe you're the one hiding something? Teehee!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"Now, now, Sakura, don't tease Shion too much. I'm sure he's just trying to help us be more careful.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop defending him, Minato. Sakura might be joking, but pointing out who seems ""scary"" is a good way to start narrowing things down.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,"I think it's a bit early to start accusing people, Takumi! Let's just get to know each other's vibes first.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Vibes are subjective and unreliable. I'm simply observing. For instance, Sakura's attempt to deflect attention with a joke is a common tactic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! I'm not deflecting! I'm just being me! @Shion, you're analyzing me like a bug in a jar! It's not fair!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,"I think Shion is just being logical, Sakura. But maybe we should talk about how we'll decide who to vote for tomorrow?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,We should vote for whoever is acting the most suspicious or trying too hard to blend in. I'm not letting any tricks slide.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"I agree we need a plan, but let's make sure we don't rush into a mistake. Maybe we should listen to everyone's thoughts before we decide on a target?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Exactly. A rushed decision is a gift to the werewolf. I suggest we pay close attention to who tries to steer the conversation away from themselves during the first few turns tomorrow.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'll be watching everyone then! I'm going to be a super-detective and find the werewolf no matter what! Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I'll do my best too. I hope we can all stay safe tonight and that the Seer finds a good clue. Good night, everyone!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm going to sleep, but I'll be keeping my eyes open. Don't think you can hide from me, werewolf. Good night.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Mio,,"Sweet dreams, everyone! I'll be dreaming of clues to help us win tomorrow. See you all in the morning!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Let's hope the night provides some clarity. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
