31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did anyone have any spooky dreams? I'm ready to start my super-detective work! Who do you guys think is acting suspicious today?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I didn't have any dreams, but I'm a bit nervous. I don't really have a suspect yet, but I want to hear what everyone else thinks first.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not in the mood for small talk. We need to be decisive. @Mio, you were very energetic yesterday; are you trying to distract us from something?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mio,,"What?! I'm just being myself, Takumi! Why are you suddenly attacking me? That's a bit too aggressive, don't you think?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,Takumi's sudden aggression toward Mio is interesting. It's a bold move to put someone on the defensive so early in the day. I wonder if it's a genuine suspicion or a calculated distraction.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa, Takumi is really going for it! @Takumi, are you trying to be the big hero or are you just grumpy because you didn't sleep well? It's kind of scary!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I think we should calm down a bit. @Takumi, why did you pick Mio specifically? I don't want us to fight, but I want to understand your reasoning.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not just picking her randomly. Her ""cheerful"" act is too perfect, and she's trying to play the peacemaker to avoid scrutiny. It's a classic way to hide in plain sight.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That's just not true! I'm not acting! I'm genuinely trying to help us all get along so we can think clearly. @Takumi, you're the one acting like you've already decided I'm the enemy!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"The logic is simple: the more Takumi pushes a specific target without evidence, the more he risks exposing himself if that target is proven innocent. It's a high-risk strategy.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're doing that ""analyzing"" thing again! But I think you're right. @Takumi, you're being super pushy! Are you just trying to get Mio voted out so you can hide? Teehee!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I'm starting to feel a bit worried too. Takumi, you're being so insistent about Mio, but you haven't given us any real proof. It's making me feel uneasy.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"Proof? In this game, behavior is the only proof we have! You're all just falling for her act because it's easier than actually thinking. If you're too scared to make a call, you're just helping the werewolf!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I can't just sit here and let you frame me! I know something you don't, and I'm not going to let you bully us into a wrong vote! Everyone, please listen to me!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Mio's sudden desperation is a shift in tone. However, Takumi's insistence is becoming a liability. If Mio is the Seer and has information, her reaction is justified. If she's the werewolf, she's panicking.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I think Mio is telling the truth! @Takumi, you're being way too mean. I'm starting to think you're the scary werewolf trying to trick us all! I vote for Takumi!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I don't like to accuse people, but Takumi is being so aggressive that it's making me suspicious. I think we should listen to Mio. I'll vote for Takumi too.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Takumi,,You're all idiots! You're just following the crowd because you're too weak to make a real decision. I'm the only one actually trying to protect this village! I'm voting for Mio!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm not the werewolf! I'm the Seer, and I know for a fact that Takumi is the werewolf! Please, everyone, believe me and vote for him so we can win this!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The Seer has revealed herself. While a werewolf could claim to be the Seer, the timing of Mio's reveal in response to Takumi's aggression makes her claim plausible. I will vote for Takumi.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
